  1. Portfolio       -- wallet home, held bounties list, status badges, total value
  2. Bounty Detail     -- single bounty: terms, judge status, collateral, timeline
  3. Redeem          -- outcome confirmed, claim collateral + payout
  4. Transfer        -- send bearer .bounty file to new holder
  5. Import          -- add a .bounty file to wallet by paste or upload
"""
